      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2007003010010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "もっちろん！　いやぁ、改めて見るとすごいよね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700301/2007003010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……やっぱり案内を頼んで良かったよ\r\nひとりだったら、ちょっと腰が引けてたかもしれない",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007003010020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "たまにはプロデューサー孝行しとかないとね\r\nこれもアイドルの務めってヤツ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700301/2007003010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007003010030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……でも、最近のファッションを勉強したい！　なんて、\r\nプロデューサーも真面目だよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700301/2007003010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "仕事に必要なことだからな\r\n流行りものに強いわけでもないし、きちんと見とかないと",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007003010040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おおっ、プロデューサーっぽい発言！　さすが！\r\nじゃあさっそく行ってみよう！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700301/2007003010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どこからまわればいいんだ……？",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007003010050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そんな難しく考えなくても大丈夫だからさ\r\nとりあえず、気の向くままってことで！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700301/2007003010050"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": 1000,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000
    }
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ここは雑貨屋か……お、メガネも売ってる",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華の場合は実用も兼ねてると思うけど、\r\nやっぱりファッションの面からも重要なんだよな……？",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007003010060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おっ！　Ｐさん、いい目のつけどころだね～！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700301/2007003010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007003010070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "メガネひとつで、結構印象が変わったりするからね\r\nかなり大事だよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700301/2007003010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007003010080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "だって、三峰が違うメガネかけてきたらもう別人でしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700301/2007003010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……？",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007003010090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あー。プロデューサー、全然ピンときてないね？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700301/2007003010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007003010100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ほらほらよく見といて",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700301/2007003010100"
  },
  {
