  {
    "id": 2007003010110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "じゃじゃ～ん！　どう？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700301/2007003010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお……よく似合ってる\r\nそのフレーム、猫の形……かな？　うん。いいな、それ",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007003010120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうそう！　面白いでしょ～？\r\nこれをかけとけば、猫ちゃん２匹連れ歩けちゃうわけ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700301/2007003010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007003010130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "でもって、これといつものメガネだったら、\r\n違う感じに見える気がしない？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700301/2007003010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、確かに珍しい",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007003010140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おわかりいただけたようで何よりです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700301/2007003010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "右と左で色違いなのも、ポイントだったりするのか？",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007003010150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "飲み込みが早いですねＰくん、いいですよ～\r\n答えはイエス！　可愛いでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700301/2007003010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "white2",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "ffffff"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
